---
title: "leaderboard_points_calculation (Sherlock Watsons)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_get_history: retrieve watson contest history
    q_get_history --> q_window: select last 70 contest-days of contests
    q_window --> q_iter_contest: for each contest in window
    q_iter_contest --> q_get_days: contest_days = duration of contest
    q_get_days --> q_get_share: watson_share = watson_issue_points / total_issue_points
    q_get_share --> q_get_pool: contest_pool = sum(all_participant_leaderboard_points) + inflation
    q_get_pool --> q_weighted: weighted_score = (watson_share * contest_pool) * (contest_days / total_window_days)
    q_weighted --> q_iter_contest: next contest
    q_iter_contest --> q_sum: all contests processed
    q_sum --> q_leaderboard: leaderboard_points = sum(weighted_scores)
    q_leaderboard --> [*]: return leaderboard_points

    note right of q_window
        INV-001: Rolling window = last 70 contest-days (10 contest-weeks)
        INV-002: If watson has < 70 contest-days, all contests count with higher individual weight
    end note

    note right of q_weighted
        INV-003: Weight per contest = contest_days / total_days_in_window
        INV-004: Longer contests have proportionally more influence
        INV-005: Old scores drop off after 70 contest-days window
    end note
